{
	"info": {
		"name": "Clover API",
		"description": "API маркетплейса Клевер.\n\nАрхитектура: API Gateway (nginx :8080) → микросервисы.\n\n- Auth Service (:8001 HTTP, :8003 gRPC)\n- Support Service (:8002 HTTP)\n- Catalog Service (:8004 HTTP, :8005 gRPC) — объявления, поиск, избранное, просмотры, категории\n- Commerce Service (:8006 HTTP) — корзина, чаты, заказы\n\nПеременные:\n- `gateway` — через nginx (http://localhost:8080)\n- `authDirect` — напрямую к auth (http://localhost:8001)\n- `supportDirect` — напрямую к support (http://localhost:8002)\n- `catalogDirect` — напрямую к catalog (http://localhost:8004)\n- `commerceDirect` — напрямую к commerce (http://localhost:8006)\n\nНовые группы (с миграции 000020):\n- Wallet (Commerce) — внутренний кошелёк пользователя\n- Promotion (Commerce) — платное продвижение объявлений (boost/highlight)",
		"schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
	},
	"variable": [
		{
			"key": "gateway",
			"value": "http://localhost:8080/api/v1",
			"description": "Через API Gateway (nginx)"
		},
		{
			"key": "authDirect",
			"value": "http://localhost:8001/api/v1",
			"description": "Напрямую к Auth Service"
		},
		{
			"key": "supportDirect",
			"value": "http://localhost:8002/api/v1",
			"description": "Напрямую к Support Service"
		},
		{
			"key": "catalogDirect",
			"value": "http://localhost:8004/api/v1",
			"description": "Напрямую к Catalog Service"
		},
		{
			"key": "commerceDirect",
			"value": "http://localhost:8006/api/v1",
			"description": "Напрямую к Commerce Service"
		},
		{
			"key": "baseUrl",
			"value": "http://localhost:8080/api/v1",
			"description": "Активный URL (по умолчанию — gateway)"
		},
		{
			"key": "adId",
			"value": "1"
		},
		{
			"key": "userId",
			"value": "1"
		},
		{
